    "description": "SPEC-v1 \u00a75.2 rule 3 and \u00a76.6-\u00a76.7: a boss joined to a plate, a fillet of the boss's root ring, then a chamfer of the boss's top ring. The fillet does not touch the top ring, so its edge keeps its key e2/edge:{e2/cap:end@ring|e2/side:ring} (only modified entities keep their keys; untouched ones even more so): the chamfer's report lists that key"
